    <summary>A powerful CLI tool to repair 3D mesh files (STL, 3MF, OBJ, etc.)</summary>
    <description>
MeshRepair is a command-line tool that repairs broken 3D mesh files using Windows 3D Printing API and PrusaSlicer.

## Features
- Interactive Mode: Run without arguments for guided experience
- STL Export: Convert repaired models back to STL format
- Progress Tracking: Visual progress for batch processing
- Multiple Formats: Supports STL, STEP, 3MF, OBJ, AMF
- Batch Processing: Repair entire folders with folder hierarchy cloning

## Usage
Interactive mode:
```
meshrepair
```

Command line:
```
meshrepair --inputFilePath "C:\Models" --outputFormat stl
```

Quick defaults:
```
meshrepair -d
```
    </description>
